\f0\fs24 \cf0 This app allows controlling the volume of Apple Music, Spotify and Doppler with the shortcuts [
\f1 \cf2 \uc0\u8984 
\f0  CMD] + [Vol. up] or \cf0 [
\f1 \cf2 \uc0\u8984 
\f0  CMD] + [Vol. down].\
\
You can toggle whether the modifier key [
\f1 \uc0\u8984 
\f0  CMD] controls the volume of the current music app or the system volume.\cf0 \
\
